        "sid": "2CH 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Amasiya gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew diktam ea shageash aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yehoadani bea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak hean gwasin nea magasa gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ghwanyas uurda muuchi aba jeeda gheambalmeadaanyi hean ghabwar gameewa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ghayi nuus sugoocheanda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nea diibiga nyaawa ea mabwara gameewa, gawuurji gising'oorsa jeeda deaweeda, jeeda gitaabooda Musa, heeda ghayi rukuta NG'UTAMIIDA, gideaba, “Ghweaniga adiidu gameewa aba ramaseanda diibiga, ghana diibiga adiidu gameewa aba ramaseanda ghweaniga nyaawa; gaygaba siisi meah aba badayda riing'eadaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda sea fuga Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat Amasiya headiga Yuda, ak ghwanung' ghabeawa gealga ghweaniga nyaawa ak ghwanung' gamiineadaysa saawa shirikareeda hees miineadayiisa shirikareeda was sagalamnyoojiga ea bughalajeega bea fuga sean bea Yuda ea Benjamini. Hean ghaghwal fuga bea gweanyeew diktam ea gea naawda, ak ghwanyas mooneeda nyaawa gideaba ghwanyiit fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji samwagu was fuga sighwal hit aba ng'ucheeda, fuga ammu ghwaat ng'utkeaka ea igeambooniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw gadiyeeda fih sagalamnyooji bughala mideawa uurjeenga bea ng'ucheeda leabu Israeli aba dalaantaji bughala bea lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu headaanyi siida ASEETA ak gwayeesha, “Ea sugoocheanda, adiidu giideayeewi lugooda Israeli; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA manda heeda fuga Israeli, sea fiisu seaniin bea Efraimuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba iyeeshi geawi aba naweani gideaba gay nyasa uurda jea ng'ucheewana, gayghwanung' ASEETA abeedeaysiina madeeda weajoodigaagu, aba gideaba ASEETA ghoamu ghaweanyi nea ghoamu gwajaktaneey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Amasiya siida ASEETA, “Ak abeeda gabeaheesa naaha aba badayda dalaantaji bughala ghayi naadawji shirikareeda fuga Israeli?” Hean gwayeesha siida ASEETA, “NG'UTAMIIDA ghoamu gea saang'a burdeawa suh.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaarda Amasiya shirikareeda hidu headaanyi leabu Efraimu, ak ghwanung' gabiikta gealga nyaawa. Hean gwanyareeksa saawa Yuda, ak gabiikta gealga nyaawa aba nyarasta ng'waan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goomajeek gurooroadaanyi Amasiya, ak goosheedeawa fugaaschi, ak gaweay ea ghwahita moangoachiyda balang'da, hean ghabwar gameewa fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush bea Seyiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'waay fuga Yuda fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush was fuga majeekcheewi, ak ghwaat ea ghoahiita uhuuda lagheaneeda, aba ng'ata goong'adeana saawa uhuuda lagheaneeda; ak hean gagiishachi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga lugooda ghayi nung' Amasiya gabiikta ghoah, was gea ghayi moodeayeewana niny ng'ucheeda, ghaghas mujiinajeega Yuda gidang'eada Samariya ea gagul Bet-horoni, ak gwanuus fih sagalamnyooji samwagu aba jeeda nyaawa, ak gageanda easanga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata nea nibiigu Amasiya aba heeda bayiiga fuga Edomu, hean gweadu aseecheeka fuga Seyiri, ak ghamiinda ghoah aseecheekaaschi, ak ghabwat, nea ghoadaw haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Amasiya, ak hean goojeaksa sibaneeda, was dea eesha niny, “Ghwasaan anda nigaseadi aseecheeka buuneeda, was gea moamu gwalealu fuga nyaawa aba geatingaagu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean damanda gudugabalool gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Aseasa siyiinyeey huwa siichea goorgweakiiseasa? Siinda! Ghwasaan ang'iing'i anda meenuusnyi?” Hean ghwasiinda sibaneeda, ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ghana gideaba ASEETA nigasa gideaba gaygwanuusnyi aba gideaba nisini ng'asheanji nea ea miileeysiini iita girgweageedeanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda sea fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabalool Amasiyaheeda was sugoocheanda Yuda ak goojeaksa Yoashi was orjeeda Yehoahasi bea Yehu, was sugoocheanda Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Beeni eeroonyeena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Yoashi was sugoocheanda Israeli goojeakta ng'asheanda heeda sugoocheanda Yuda siguura Amasiya ak gwayeesha, “Sawacheanda aba Lebanoni niijeaksa gubooyeanda aba Lebanoni, ak gwayeesha, ‘Goonean hudaang'u ghaghi orjeedeanyu;’ ak ghwala hooweani diyeayda jarooda bea Lebanoni ak gooleapsa ng'eanyi sawacheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea niyeeni, ‘Ng'ula, naabwarji Edomu,’ ak ea nigatkanyi gurooroadaang'u ea gwarsiina geaw. Asi apteada aba gheang'u; ghwasaan anda gigasayi jaksiina geaw jeeda haloota jea ghwanung' abeada, ang'iing'i ea Yuda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mooleeysiina iita Amasiya; aba gideaba ng'asheesu gwaleabu heeda ASEETA, gideaba gayghoahaak saawa geatinga weajoodiga nyaawa, aba gideaba nigaseada aseecheeka fuga Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gwadiyeada Yoasheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli; ak gwaroonyi niny sea Amasiya sugoocheanda Yuda aba jeeda ng'ucheeda aba Bet-shemeshi, bea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yuda ghwajoar fuga Israeli; ak gaba siisi mang'awsa gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Yoasheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli ghoang'waayi Amasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda was orjeeda Yoashi, bea Ahasiya, aba Bet-shemeshi, ak gweadu niny ea ghwahidu Yerusalemu, ak gwanyarja ghamarda Yerusalemu, gidang'eada gidaghuuta Efraimu ea gagul gidaghuuta washiin geatin bughalaji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda dahaabooda sean, ea lapiya, ea haleanjeeda sean sinyasa jeeda gheeda ASEETA sea gheeh Obed-edomu, ak ghoang'waay heeda siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda bea gheeda sugoocheanda ak ghoang'waayi buuneeda, ak gabiikta Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida Amasiyaheeda was orjeeda Yoashi was sugoocheanda Yuda, gweanyeew damanamuut, iing'ata miyeeda Yehoashi was orjeeda Yehoahasi was sugoocheanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda sean siipuut bea Amasiya gidang'eada gea madeeda ea gea huuydean, ng'ula, miyeeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Yuda ea Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gidang'eada damanda yamwa geaw Amasiya ak gwanung'usa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean geebada ng'asheega munyas aba badaydaanyi aba Yerusalemu; hean gamng'aw ea ghwahita Lakishi, ng'ata geecheakta fuga jea ghwaat geeshta aba Lakishi, ak geenuuksa hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
